  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Jump.PrefixNotWalkable>Нельзя пройти, </RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Jump.PrefixNotWalkable>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Jump.PrefixCanJump>Можно прыгнуть, </RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Jump.PrefixCanJump>

